WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.333
Playground AI: a learning workspace inside Canvas.
Animated walkthrough using sample course content.

00:04.333 --> 00:12.333
Open Playground AI from a Canvas course.
Course files appear in the workspace alongside the chat.

00:12.333 --> 00:18.000
Ask: Explain the pigeonhole principle from Lec 3.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.667
The answer explains the principle and links back to Lec 3.pdf.
With 13 people and 12 months, two people share a birth month.

00:23.667 --> 00:29.000
Select a region of a course PDF and attach it to a question.

00:29.000 --> 00:34.667
Ask what the highlighted theorem means.
The explanation uses the selected passage as context.

00:34.667 --> 00:42.667
Explore the knowledge graph:
course concepts are connected to related lecture files.

00:42.667 --> 00:47.667
Playground AI brings course materials, questions,
and connected concepts into one workspace.
